0..77 Comment "// Representation independence of two structures with operations: the toggles"
78..155 Comment "// of Sterling, Gratzer and Birkedal\'s counters (_Towards univalent reference"
156..231 Comment "// types_, § 5, `posCounter ≡ negCounter`), related along negation. Each"
232..308 Comment "// operation is carried along the carrier\'s path, its argument moved back by"
309..385 Comment "// the equivalence\'s backward map and its result forward by its forward map,"
386..463 Comment "// and the carried operation is related to the other structure\'s by `funext`."
464..537 Comment "// A reading carried between two different carriers, booleans tagged with"
538..588 Comment "// unit and the booleans, is related the same way."
590..652 Comment "// Negation, `not`, and the identity, `same`, on the booleans."
